    5, 'en', 'Absolutely amazing service, staff are great, doctors are knowledgable and so helpful. I was admitted with acute asthma. I didn\'t expect to be communicated in my language but in a stressful situation they spoke to me in english and I appreciate that especially when you cant breathe and I could not remember any of my local language skills :))). This hospital should receive better recognition and the staff. Bravo!!',
