    'places/ChIJwQSxMXwzTBMRwrW_e_eeazs/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25sWFpHMXROR1phUjFkb1duWkZkVFpaVjA5Rk1rRRAB',
    5, 'en', 'While on holiday in Kotor I had severe toothache,and my Hotel was able to make an urgent appointment. I received a full consultation, examination, xrays and advice, and the treatment was carried out carefully and successfully. The Dentist made several follow up calls afterwards to make sure I was healing properly, important because we were travelling on from Kotor for the rest of our holiday. Whilst it was unfortunate to have dental pain on holiday, it was very fortunate to have this Dentist to treat me! It was especially helpful that it could all be discussed in the English language as we were obviously a long way from home. Thanks for the service.',
    NULL, NULL, 'While on holiday in Kotor I had severe toothache,and my Hotel was able to make an urgent appointment. I received a full consultation, examination, xrays and advice, and the treatment was carried out carefully and successfully. The Dentist made several follow up calls afterwards to make sure I was healing properly, important because we were travelling on from Kotor for the rest of our holiday. Whilst it was unfortunate to have dental pain on holiday, it was very fortunate to have this Dentist to treat me! It was especially helpful that it could all be discussed in the English language as we were obviously a long way from home. Thanks for the service.', NULL, NULL, NULL,
