    5, 'en', 'Every year, we come to Montenegro for our holiday, and we always make time to visit the best dental clinic in Montenegro. Excellent quality at a very reasonable price, with a professional and friendly approach. We highly recommend this clinic — 100%! 🇲🇪🦷❤️',
