    4, 'en', 'Thank you so much Dr.Marija Zekić. I had my foot infected and another doctor gave me some mild medication that didn’t work, it only got worse. But Marija Zekić checked me, gave me several kinds of really good medications and I feel much better now. She is very careful to patients and a good specialist. Best doctor in this hospital!',
