    1, 'en', 'Just avoid the trouble. They wont even explain the MR scan results. They just hand it to you, off you go. Btw MRI room is quite suffocating to stay 45min in the capsule, and they will say ventilation works regardless, but you WILL feel sick, but they don\'t care. Just go to another one, this is a joke.',
