(@user_anna_pokinbara, @clinic_id, NULL, 'google_maps',
    'places/ChIJIbSQ2AEzTBMRpQCUavb3SfM/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pGeVprTnZOMmQxZFdwdGRFWjFkMVI0Y25Rd1VuYxAB',
    5, 'en', 'I was brought here (gynecology department of KBC) from Tivat by emergency services and had urgent surgery. Dr. Antonia Mihaljević is a true professional and diagnosed my condition quickly and accurately.

Unfortunately, I don’t know the name of my surgeon; I only remember that she was a woman. I was left with only a small, subtle scar after the abdominal surgery, as well as a small scar from the drainage.

I am so grateful to everyone at this hospital. Every person I interacted with was polite, kind, and attentive. I didn’t even ask their names because I was quite shocked at the time, but I have never felt more cared for and supported.

I am not a local and I don’t speak Montenegrin, but that was never a problem there. Thank you so much to everyone who took care of me.',
    NULL, NULL, 'I was brought here (gynecology department of KBC) from Tivat by emergency services and had urgent surgery. Dr. Antonia Mihaljević is a true professional and diagnosed my condition quickly and accurately.

Unfortunately, I don’t know the name of my surgeon; I only remember that she was a woman. I was left with only a small, subtle scar after the abdominal surgery, as well as a small scar from the drainage.

I am so grateful to everyone at this hospital. Every person I interacted with was polite, kind, and attentive. I didn’t even ask their names because I was quite shocked at the time, but I have never felt more cared for and supported.

I am not a local and I don’t speak Montenegrin, but that was never a problem there. Thank you so much to everyone who took care of me.', NULL, NULL, NULL,
    0, '2026-08-29 00:00:00'),

(@user_arif_metin_ko, @clinic_id, NULL, 'google_maps',
    'places/ChIJIbSQ2AEzTBMRpQCUavb3SfM/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5aFMwWkdYM0E0VVVSYVV6STRXSFk0YzJKSExYYxAB',
    1, 'tr', 'Umarım yolunuz düşmez. Bebeğimiz ateşlendiği için acil olarak giriş yaptık ve o akşam kalmamız gerektiği, sabah doktorun gelip bakacağı iletildi. Bu süre zarfında Türkiye\'deki doktor arkadaşlarımızla devamlı görüşme halindeydik. Notlarımızı paylaştığımızda Türkiye\'deki doktorlardan tavsiye almayacağını söyleyip saçma sapan teşhislerle alakası olmayan bir antibiyotik uyguladı ve bilerek reçete yazmadılar. Bir çocuğun sağlığı maalesef egolarının üzerinde yer almaktadır. Bunu düşünerek hareket etmenizi önerimim.',
    NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Umarım yolunuz düşmez. Bebeğimiz ateşlendiği için acil olarak giriş yaptık ve o akşam kalmamız gerektiği, sabah doktorun gelip bakacağı iletildi. Bu süre zarfında Türkiye\'deki doktor arkadaşlarımızla devamlı görüşme halindeydik. Notlarımızı paylaştığımızda Türkiye\'deki doktorlardan tavsiye almayacağını söyleyip saçma sapan teşhislerle alakası olmayan bir antibiyotik uyguladı ve bilerek reçete yazmadılar. Bir çocuğun sağlığı maalesef egolarının üzerinde yer almaktadır. Bunu düşünerek hareket etmenizi önerimim.',
    0, '2026-07-29 00:00:00'),

(@user_renan_menezes, @clinic_id, NULL, 'google_maps',
    'places/ChIJIbSQ2AEzTBMRpQCUavb3SfM/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25sUmNXZE9jMEUyUWtrM1ptWmlWa05yWVdneWRtYxAB',
    1, 'en', 'The nurse supervisor, the stuck-up blonde from the second floor, was extremely rude and impolite. I was lost upstairs and looking for the stairs, but she made a scene about it. I almost punched her in the face after hearing such disrespect. Thank God I controlled myself and didn\'t attack her. All I did was ask where the stairs were so I could go down and get lunch for my wife. That awful supervisor needs to learn to respect people. It\'s lucky for her that I\'m not an alcoholic, because I would have escalated the situation due to her disrespect at that moment when I was just doing my job and taking care of my wife. She has a lot to learn, but I don\'t recommend this place to anyone. Don\'t go to this hospital. They charge 300 euros only to send you to another doctor at another hospital with even worse reviews. All the hospitals in Montenegro are neglected and the government simply does nothing. People are ashamed of this place, and honestly, I don\'t recommend returning to this country. Everything has become extremely overpriced, a large part of the taxi drivers are part of the mafia and constantly scam people. It\'s not like it used to be. I\'ve been to this country five times and always loved it, but this is the first time I\'ve come and I hate the experience as a whole. In this country, you pay a lot to be treated badly. Of course, there are exceptions, like most restaurants being good and many very nice people, but if you get sick and end up in a hospital, you will feel it.',
    NULL, NULL, 'The nurse supervisor, the stuck-up blonde from the second floor, was extremely rude and impolite. I was lost upstairs and looking for the stairs, but she made a scene about it. I almost punched her in the face after hearing such disrespect. Thank God I controlled myself and didn\'t attack her. All I did was ask where the stairs were so I could go down and get lunch for my wife. That awful supervisor needs to learn to respect people. It\'s lucky for her that I\'m not an alcoholic, because I would have escalated the situation due to her disrespect at that moment when I was just doing my job and taking care of my wife. She has a lot to learn, but I don\'t recommend this place to anyone. Don\'t go to this hospital. They charge 300 euros only to send you to another doctor at another hospital with even worse reviews. All the hospitals in Montenegro are neglected and the government simply does nothing. People are ashamed of this place, and honestly, I don\'t recommend returning to this country. Everything has become extremely overpriced, a large part of the taxi drivers are part of the mafia and constantly scam people. It\'s not like it used to be. I\'ve been to this country five times and always loved it, but this is the first time I\'ve come and I hate the experience as a whole. In this country, you pay a lot to be treated badly. Of course, there are exceptions, like most restaurants being good and many very nice people, but if you get sick and end up in a hospital, you will feel it.', NULL, NULL, NULL,
    0, '2026-07-29 00:00:00'),

