(@user_jimi_zhang, @clinic_id, NULL, 'google_maps',
    'places/ChIJg0x9d_zrTRMRFannRP3pXOM/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tvelMzWlhVRjlYTW5wcmFVRTJhMGhNY2tkUldHYxAB',
    5, 'en', 'My mother required surgery for symptoms of acute appendicitis while our family was travelling. The operating surgeon, Dr. Batric Vukčević, was very thorough and patient with us. As foreign visitors travelling in Montenegro, he took great care to explain her medical condition to me in English in great detail.
During hospitalization, all nurses and cardiologists were highly dedicated. They checked on my mother every 15‑20 minutes. This gave my mother a memorable and reassuring experience while being treated far away from home.
I would like to express my gratitude to everyone who took care of my mother.',
    NULL, NULL, 'My mother required surgery for symptoms of acute appendicitis while our family was travelling. The operating surgeon, Dr. Batric Vukčević, was very thorough and patient with us. As foreign visitors travelling in Montenegro, he took great care to explain her medical condition to me in English in great detail.
During hospitalization, all nurses and cardiologists were highly dedicated. They checked on my mother every 15‑20 minutes. This gave my mother a memorable and reassuring experience while being treated far away from home.
I would like to express my gratitude to everyone who took care of my mother.', NULL, NULL, NULL,
    0, '2026-08-29 00:00:00'),

