    5, 'en', 'My contact lens got stuck and it was quite painful. Ladies from the ordination took a great care of me and afterwards I got checked by the doctor herself. Great experience, very pleasant and helpful. 10/10',
    NULL, NULL, 'My contact lens got stuck and it was quite painful. Ladies from the ordination took a great care of me and afterwards I got checked by the doctor herself. Great experience, very pleasant and helpful. 10/10', NULL, NULL, NULL,
