    5, 'en', 'Huge shoutout to the brilliant Dr. Vanja Banićević — who took one look at the right side of my otherwise empty skull, spotted an ugly mole that had clearly overstayed its welcome, and lasered it into oblivion in under two minutes.

In the time it takes most people to decide what to watch on Netflix, Dr. Banićević solved a problem I’d been ignoring for way too long. Painless, quick, and with a sense of humor that made me forget I technically had a minor medical procedure.

If you ever need something zapped off your head — or just want to meet a doctor who works at lightspeed with a laser and a smile — she’s your person. Thank you, Dr. Banićević, for making mole removal feel like a magic trick. You’re a legend. ✨',
    NULL, NULL, 'Huge shoutout to the brilliant Dr. Vanja Banićević — who took one look at the right side of my otherwise empty skull, spotted an ugly mole that had clearly overstayed its welcome, and lasered it into oblivion in under two minutes.

In the time it takes most people to decide what to watch on Netflix, Dr. Banićević solved a problem I’d been ignoring for way too long. Painless, quick, and with a sense of humor that made me forget I technically had a minor medical procedure.

If you ever need something zapped off your head — or just want to meet a doctor who works at lightspeed with a laser and a smile — she’s your person. Thank you, Dr. Banićević, for making mole removal feel like a magic trick. You’re a legend. ✨', NULL, NULL, NULL,
    0, '2026-05-29 00:00:00'),

(@user_olga_kuznetsova, @clinic_id, NULL, 'google_maps',
