    5, 'fr', 'Très bon accueil.  Pas d attente. Tous les examens et soins sont faits sur place. Top',
    NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL,
    0, '2026-09-29 00:00:00'),

(@user_igor_obradovic, @clinic_id, NULL, 'google_maps',
    'places/ChIJuxjlT4PUTRMRicGlnIKLGxA/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tnMFR6UlVZV1UxUnpZeGNVTTJPVVl0ZEVZMmNGRRAB',
    5, 'en', 'We visited Milmedika Budva on a Sunday with our six year old son, who had a fever and severe cough. Despite the clinic being packed and under heavy pressure, the team welcomed us with incredible calm, warmth, and professionalism.
Nurses Spasenja Đukanović and Svetlana Vujanović were phenomenal. Their kindness, patience, and gentle approach immediately put our son at ease and brought us immense peace of mind. A special thank you goes to pediatrician Dr. Ana Lopičić Kašćelan - an exceptional specialist and a wonderful person whose thoroughness, warmth, and dedication set a standard every pediatrician should follow.
The organization was seamless: blood work and CRP were completed on-site without delay, followed immediately by a follow-up review and an appropriate treatment plan.
We live in Germany and have experienced healthcare facilities across Europe and around the world, but this rare combination of speed, clinical expertise, and heartfelt compassion truly exceeds global standards. Highest recommendations and sincere thanks to the entire team!',
    NULL, NULL, 'We visited Milmedika Budva on a Sunday with our six year old son, who had a fever and severe cough. Despite the clinic being packed and under heavy pressure, the team welcomed us with incredible calm, warmth, and professionalism.
Nurses Spasenja Đukanović and Svetlana Vujanović were phenomenal. Their kindness, patience, and gentle approach immediately put our son at ease and brought us immense peace of mind. A special thank you goes to pediatrician Dr. Ana Lopičić Kašćelan - an exceptional specialist and a wonderful person whose thoroughness, warmth, and dedication set a standard every pediatrician should follow.
The organization was seamless: blood work and CRP were completed on-site without delay, followed immediately by a follow-up review and an appropriate treatment plan.
We live in Germany and have experienced healthcare facilities across Europe and around the world, but this rare combination of speed, clinical expertise, and heartfelt compassion truly exceeds global standards. Highest recommendations and sincere thanks to the entire team!', NULL, NULL, NULL,
    0, '2026-09-29 00:00:00'),

