    1, 'en', 'The staff are rude. I was waiting on the doctor\'s side, I\'m a patient. They said there was another patient with an appointment. I said okay. Of course, they\'ll go in before me. But they made me get up from where I was sitting. By what right?! How rude! The reason was so the patient before me could sit down. And you\'re not even a doctor, yet you\'re shamelessly asking for a blood test. I got up and left. You\'re a complete money trap. May God not let anyone fall into your hands. This happens even before you go to the doctor.',
