(@user_alla_mamontova, @clinic_id, NULL, 'google_maps',
    'places/ChIJ24AT6zwxTBMRTJ_DTbDN1oc/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pGbFQzTmllV2QzWlcwdFZESkVTVk5CUm1SMFZGRRAB',
    5, 'en', 'We were on vacation with our autistic son when we had a delicate and stressful situation arise. We walked into this clinic feeling quite desperate, but Dr. Milica Vušurović was absolutely wonderful — incredibly tactful, understanding, and patient. Despite the language barrier (our son doesn’t speak Serbian and only understands a little English), she quickly found a way to connect with him and put him at ease. The reception staff were equally kind and understanding, and everyone spoke English, which made everything so much easier during a stressful moment. We’re so grateful for the care and compassion shown to our family.',
    NULL, NULL, 'We were on vacation with our autistic son when we had a delicate and stressful situation arise. We walked into this clinic feeling quite desperate, but Dr. Milica Vušurović was absolutely wonderful — incredibly tactful, understanding, and patient. Despite the language barrier (our son doesn’t speak Serbian and only understands a little English), she quickly found a way to connect with him and put him at ease. The reception staff were equally kind and understanding, and everyone spoke English, which made everything so much easier during a stressful moment. We’re so grateful for the care and compassion shown to our family.', NULL, NULL, NULL,
    1, '2026-08-29 00:00:00'),

