    3, 'en', 'A good service: no queue, fast service, fast test results, kind personnel but I came with pain and the ultrasound did not show anything abnormal. Good that I still got a treatment - it maybe saved my life but the next clinic found serious problem with thrombosis. I took the second appointment because 2 weeks after the treatment the pain came back. But the check for it was almost 4 hundred. The doctor who found the problem got 80 euro. Okey, high prices are okey if you really can identify and treat the illness but in this case…',
    NULL, NULL, 'A good service: no queue, fast service, fast test results, kind personnel but I came with pain and the ultrasound did not show anything abnormal. Good that I still got a treatment - it maybe saved my life but the next clinic found serious problem with thrombosis. I took the second appointment because 2 weeks after the treatment the pain came back. But the check for it was almost 4 hundred. The doctor who found the problem got 80 euro. Okey, high prices are okey if you really can identify and treat the illness but in this case…', NULL, NULL, NULL,
    0, '2026-05-29 00:00:00'),

(@user_sasha_zavalnyuk, @clinic_id, NULL, 'google_maps',
    'places/ChIJ24AT6zwxTBMRTJ_DTbDN1oc/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkblVUbDFlV3h2YjFCMFRWRkdNVVJ4TWs1SVRtYxAB',
    1, 'es', 'Quiero compartir mi experiencia en esta clínica... Llegué con un informe médico y análisis parciales, pero me quejaba de dolor en el pecho, con sospecha de reflujo. Me derivaron a varias pruebas, que me realicé durante dos semanas, con un coste total aproximado de 700 €. Al final, no me curaron del todo, solo me dieron un alivio temporal. ¿Qué conclusión saqué? Que su objetivo es sacarte más dinero, sin importarles si te recuperas o no... Probablemente así funciona su sistema. De hecho, mi nivel de azúcar en sangre también estaba elevado a 6,8, lo que se considera prediabetes, y nadie me lo comentó, a pesar de que me recetaron las mismas pastillas que llevaba tomando desde hacía tiempo y que no me hacían efecto. Fui a otra clínica, y tras la primera consulta me recetaron tratamiento, y me recuperé en 5-7 días.',
    NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL,
    1, '2026-05-29 00:00:00'),

(@user_her, @clinic_id, NULL, 'google_maps',
    'places/ChIJ24AT6zwxTBMRTJ_DTbDN1oc/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT205RVNtZFZlWEYxUTB0bE5sZGFOa0ZFV0VONlUzYxAB',
    2, 'en', 'I had a very disappointing experience at this clinic. Before the procedure, I was quoted €200 for the cauterization of three little warts. However, when it came time to pay, I was suddenly charged €400 with no proper explanation or prior warning about the increase in price.

What makes the situation even worse is that the treatment was not even effective — I still have the warts, meaning the procedure either was not done properly or was incomplete. Paying double the agreed price for unsuccessful treatment is unacceptable.

I understand that medical procedures can vary, but transparency and professionalism are essential. If the cost was going to change, this should have been communicated before the treatment, not after it was already done.

Unfortunately, I left feeling overcharged, misled, and dissatisfied with the results. I would not recommend this clinic based on my experience.',
    NULL, NULL, 'I had a very disappointing experience at this clinic. Before the procedure, I was quoted €200 for the cauterization of three little warts. However, when it came time to pay, I was suddenly charged €400 with no proper explanation or prior warning about the increase in price.

What makes the situation even worse is that the treatment was not even effective — I still have the warts, meaning the procedure either was not done properly or was incomplete. Paying double the agreed price for unsuccessful treatment is unacceptable.

