(@user_abhishek_tripathi, @clinic_id, NULL, 'google_maps',
    'places/ChIJHfFt8SHVTRMR6W1Pm-V3v7A/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCWFFXaHhUbUZ2Um5aVU0yMHdNamN6YjNaclprRRAB',
    5, 'en', 'My partner unfortunately got an ant inside her ear and it scratched her ear from inside. We tried to find an ENT specialist and found nowhere except here.

Our experience here was amazing, we were panicking before our flight as my partner has a history of perforated eardrums. The doctor, Muhedin Kadić, saw her calmly and explained that everything was okay. We loved the calmness and thoroughness of the check-up and were grateful. Highly recommend!',
    NULL, NULL, 'My partner unfortunately got an ant inside her ear and it scratched her ear from inside. We tried to find an ENT specialist and found nowhere except here.

Our experience here was amazing, we were panicking before our flight as my partner has a history of perforated eardrums. The doctor, Muhedin Kadić, saw her calmly and explained that everything was okay. We loved the calmness and thoroughness of the check-up and were grateful. Highly recommend!', NULL, NULL, NULL,
    0, '2026-10-22 00:00:00'),

(@user_ivana_vuksanovic, @clinic_id, NULL, 'google_maps',
