    5, 'ru', NULL,
    NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL,
    0, '2026-09-29 00:00:00'),

(@user_nik_kalatozov, @clinic_id, @doctor_danijela, 'google_maps',
    'places/ChIJZWa6dAnrTRMRSh7isFayii0/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t4eWNEYzFjVk5EWjA5NlJubDBZMFV6TkRRM1ZuYxAB',
    5, 'en', 'I turned up at Dr Raonic\'s clinic after noticing worrying changes with my vision. Dr Danijela examined me immediately and diagnosed multiple retinal tears, including a peripheral retinal detachment. She treated the problem the same evening with urgency and care, using laser retinopexy to seal the retina around the tears by placing laser spots around the hole. Dr Danijela dealt with the severity of my condition with extreme patience and dedication over a period of several hours, even having to cancel her own medical appointment in order to save my vision!
After the intervention, she provided me with clear and detailed guidance for the recovery, as well as regular check-ups during this period. Further examinations showed that the treatment was successful and I am very grateful to Dr Danijela and her team for taking such good care of me.
I should add that everyone at the centre, including the nurses and the receptionists, was very kind and helpful, and the general atmosphere and decor at the clinic are very pleasant and welcoming, which is a small, but important detail. I found the prices for the examination and the treatment very reasonable, too. Overall, I am extremely satisfied with my experience at Dr Raonic\'s centre, which has my highest recommendation!',
    NULL, NULL, 'I turned up at Dr Raonic\'s clinic after noticing worrying changes with my vision. Dr Danijela examined me immediately and diagnosed multiple retinal tears, including a peripheral retinal detachment. She treated the problem the same evening with urgency and care, using laser retinopexy to seal the retina around the tears by placing laser spots around the hole. Dr Danijela dealt with the severity of my condition with extreme patience and dedication over a period of several hours, even having to cancel her own medical appointment in order to save my vision!
After the intervention, she provided me with clear and detailed guidance for the recovery, as well as regular check-ups during this period. Further examinations showed that the treatment was successful and I am very grateful to Dr Danijela and her team for taking such good care of me.
I should add that everyone at the centre, including the nurses and the receptionists, was very kind and helpful, and the general atmosphere and decor at the clinic are very pleasant and welcoming, which is a small, but important detail. I found the prices for the examination and the treatment very reasonable, too. Overall, I am extremely satisfied with my experience at Dr Raonic\'s centre, which has my highest recommendation!', NULL, NULL, NULL,
    0, '2026-09-29 00:00:00'),

(@user_nenad_dule_vojinovic, @clinic_id, NULL, 'google_maps',
    'places/ChIJZWa6dAnrTRMRSh7isFayii0/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sSWJEUm1ZbGhuU2pCd2ExQkNObk14VDJWTlozYxAB',
    5, 'en', 'All praise for the Dr. Raonic Ophthalmology Center! A perfect 10/10 for their expertise, kindness, and dedication to the patient. The clinic is equipped with state-of-the-art technology, and the entire team inspires immense confidence from the moment you walk in. Professionalism at the highest level – highly recommended to anyone looking for the best care for their eyes!',
    NULL, NULL, 'All praise for the Dr. Raonic Ophthalmology Center! A perfect 10/10 for their expertise, kindness, and dedication to the patient. The clinic is equipped with state-of-the-art technology, and the entire team inspires immense confidence from the moment you walk in. Professionalism at the highest level – highly recommended to anyone looking for the best care for their eyes!', NULL, NULL, NULL,
