    5, 'en', 'I would like to express my sincere thanks to Dr Anika Dajevic and her assistant for the outstanding care I received after I had an accident during the night of 12 July and fell, requiring stitches to my face just below and above my eye. My injury was treated with exceptional skill, and I felt completely safe throughout the entire procedure, which was carried out with the utmost professionalism. The wound has healed beautifully, and the scar is now barely visible.',
