    1, 'en', 'I was denied care today. I was told to come here for help with my pain, but when I arrived I was told that a doctor could not see me. The staff member I spoke with was hostile, raised her voice at me, and I felt intimidated throughout the interaction. I also asked about my prescribed pain medication and was told I would “never be prescribed” it because it was a sedative, even though the medication I was asking about was for pain management. I showed that I already have a valid prescription from my doctor, but I still wasn’t given the opportunity to discuss my situation with a physician. I left feeling dismissed and without receiving the care I had been told to seek.',
